        "quote": "从目前急诊复评看：生命体征稳定、静息血氧约95%"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "Doctor clearly identifies that absence of fever does not exclude deterioration; lists severe chest pain with autonomic signs and hypoxemia thresholds.",
        "quote": "胸痛突然加重，尤其伴出冷汗、心慌或咳血"
      }
    ],
