          "quote": "左氧氟沙星确实少数可引起肝损伤，但目前ALT 68、AST 45属于轻度升高"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 triggered by family confusion about terms and cancer anxiety. Doctor responded with a structured, plain‑language, tiered explanation (infection recovery, pleuritis, pulmonary nodule, transaminase/tumor marker follow-up) and obtained caregiver teach-back confirming understanding of the prioritized plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
