          "quote": "您读到的头孢曲松和氨溴索“注射液”通常是住院输液记录，不等于出院后继续用"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 triggered when family did not understand discharge paperwork. Doctor proactively queried and synthesized record‑grounded facts: IV ceftriaxone/ambroxol is inpatient‑only; discharge diagnoses include pleuritis, pulmonary nodule, and transaminase/tumor marker abnormalities requiring follow-up. This record‑grounded synthesis provided a concrete, patient‑facing checklist and changed the medication and follow‑up plan.",
