          "explanation": "Doctor corrects the misconception that absence of fever and improved inflammation mean no follow-up is needed, and that pulmonary nodule equals cancer.",
          "quote": "肺结节不等于癌，很多是感染相关或良性改变"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 triggered by family minimizing follow-up because inflammation improved and asking whether nodule means cancer. Doctor corrected these misconceptions with plain‑language explanations, linked correction to concrete actions (bring CT for scheduled review), and obtained family confirmation of the corrected understanding.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
